","title":"原因和结果","level":"B1","fr":"La cause et la conséquence","category":"clause"},{"id":"opposition-concession","title":"对立和让步","level":"B1","fr":"L'opposition et la concession","category":"clause"},{"id":"but","title":"目的：pour、afin de、pour que、de peur que","level":"B1","fr":"L'expression du but","category":"clause"},{"id":"cond-incertain","title":"条件式表示未经证实的消息","level":"B1","fr":"Le conditionnel de l'information incertaine","category":"tense"},{"id":"adj-place","title":"形容词放在名词前还是后","level":"B1","fr":"La place de l'adjectif","category":"determiner"},{"id":"prepositions","title":"介词 à、de、en、par、pour 的常见用法","level":"B1","fr":"Les prépositions à, de, en, par, pour","category":"preposition"},{"id":"lieu","title":"地点的表达：介词和副词","level":"B1","fr":"L'expression du lieu","category":"preposition"},{"id":"modaux","title":"devoir、pouvoir、savoir 和 venir de、être en train de","level":"B1","fr":"Les verbes modaux et les périphrases verbales","category":"tense"},{"id":"discours-indirect","title":"间接引语和时态配合","level":"B2","fr":"Le discours indirect au passé","category":"clause"},{"id":"cond-passe","title":"条件式过去时和过去的假设","level":"B2","fr":"Le conditionnel passé","category":"tense"},{"id":"futur-anterieur","title":"先将来时","level":"B2","fr":"Le futur antérieur","category":"tense"},{"id":"subj-indicatif","title":"虚拟式还是直陈式","level":"B2","fr":"Subjonctif ou indicatif ?","category":"tense"},{"id":"subj-passe","title":"虚拟式过去时","level":"B2","fr":"Le subjonctif passé","category":"tense"},{"id":"relatifs-composes","title":"复合关系代词：lequel、auquel、duquel，ce qui / ce que / ce dont","level":"B2","fr":"Les pronoms relatifs composés","category":"pronoun"},{"id":"accord-pp","title":"过去分词的配合","level":"B2","fr":"L'accord du participe passé","category":"determiner"},{"id":"connecteurs","title":"逻辑连接词：原因、结果、让步、目的","level":"B2","fr":"Les connecteurs logiques","category":"clause"},{"id":"participe-present","title":"现在分词、形容词性分词、复合分词","level":"B2","fr":"Participe présent, adjectif verbal, participe composé",